  "description": "Walks a Rulealize rule set and writes down, for every state it visits, everything that can be observed there: which inputs are legal, whether it is final and with what result, where each legal input leads, and what each of its projections says about it. Applying that test design to a later version of the rule set is the diff, and the choices a person made are carried across it.",
